WEBVTT

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.900
An unusual visitor came to see Ryuuki in Kiyou.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.250
Happy New Year, head of the Hyou family.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.880
I am the present ruler of this country, Shi Ryuuki.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.170
Pleased to meet you.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.370
Hyou Riou-dono,

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.290
would you care for a cup of tea?

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.460
You're different from the former Emperor and your brothers.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:37.550
Your Highness, would you kindly allow me to take a look at Bakuya, the sword you are holding?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.100
The Hyou family forged Bakuya and presented it to the royal family,

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:47.020
together with its treasured twin, Kanshou.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.640
It's glowing an awful lot.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.650
Now this is a surprise.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.230
Perhaps I was wrong just to use pawns and not see the situation for myself.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.070
Riou-dono, are you involved with Jyasen-kyou?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.490
The Hyou family is traditionally ruled by women.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.910
Only women can inherit the family's supernatural powers and pass them to the next generation.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.750
The former head, my father, and I are rare exceptions to this rule.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.790
Why have you become the head?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:20.130
My sister insisted that I become the head of the family.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:25.600
Nonetheless, my sister was supposed to be the head of the family and still exerts strong influence.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.140
So you are not involved.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:32.100
There was indeed something in Sashuu I would have liked to obtain,

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:36.730
but I wouldn't go so far as to destroy Koringun when it's not necessary.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.690
I'm not an enthusiastic type.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.450
Something you'd like to obtain?

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:47.370
Yes, it would be useful to the continuation of our family if we had it.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.120
Then, why not contact Kou Shuurei?

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.300
Riou-dono,

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.550
will you not stay for tea?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.430
Perhaps when I feel like it.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:22.320
To Eigetsu was far away from Kiyou, in the depths of a mountain in Koringun, Sashuu.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.070
I'm a tiny bit jealous of you, actually.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.410
You're a man, but my mother actually wants you...

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.830
Well, more precisely Yougetsu, not you.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:42.630
It's so typical of my mother to get hold of whatever she wants.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.010
You!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.930
Did you know that the disease would spread?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:53.060
Of course I knew. That's why I used the opportunity.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.560
We did tell them, mind you.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:02.030
"Something bad will happen soon, so you should boil any water before using it."

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.360
But they laughed, and that was the end of the story.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.160
I didn't think they would listen.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:14.500
People never bother to think unless something's happening to them, right?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.420
You speak like that using his face and voice.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:24.840
Using the mouth of a man who loved people and life more than anyone else!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.260
I won't forgive... you...

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.480
Rou Ensei left for Sekiei Village ahead of Shuurei.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.240
What's up, Seiran?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.750
Impressive! You've arrived at the perfect time!

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.630
The arrangements for restoring the village are complete.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.260
The goods and people will arrive soon.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.220
Oh, such swift work!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.260
How is oujo-sama?

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.220
She's doing all right, full of energy.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.230
You've restrained yourself well. Good job!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:19.520
Shut up.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:27.570
She said that because you stayed behind, she was able to draw up a perfect battle plan.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.780
She also said that you're very precious to her.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.620
She doesn't want you so much as scratched,

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.330
so she has to do her best using her brain.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.670
She really trusts and loves you, don't you think?

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:44.960
But of course.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:55.430
She's far too mature to insist that someone stand beside her and protect her, no matter what, right?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.220
What is it?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.100
Smoke?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.520
It must be the mining gallery that Jyasen-kyou is using as a base.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.060
Yeah.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.360
Seiran, here.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.700
So, what'll you do?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.120
Do you wanna join the Princess, instead of me?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.700
Or will you stay here and do your job?

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.200
How can you be so annoying when you're a mere rice hopper?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.120
I'll see her after I've accomplished my task.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.960
What? Isn't this too much?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.050
You know I can't use swords.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.880
If you're staying with oujo-sama,
then keep it until everything is over.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.800
You know what I mean. Now get going.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.800
H-Hold on!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:38.810
Fine!

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:49.530
It's possible to protect another person from afar, but...

00:07:56.830 --> 00:08:01.250
Shuurei and the others were camping just outside of Sekiei Village.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:19.140
So Kourin didn't arrive at Sekiei Village while you were still there, right?

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:22.060
Yep, no girl like the one you described came to our village.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:28.650
She probably wandered into the mountains when the village was empty and got trapped there.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:32.780
Jyasen-kyou wanted to sacrifice you, after all.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.200
Riou-kun...

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.410
Ensei!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:47.670
Jyasen-kyou is using the mining gallery created to access Mount Ei's ores.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.510
Eigetsu-kun is somewhere in here.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.010
Yeah.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:09:00.850
Just a little while ago, people dressed in white started carrying stuff in and out really early every morning.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.350
In and out every morning? Why?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.060
Carrying out the dead bodies.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:07.980
Yeah.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:08.440
What?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.610
So, in that case...

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:19.660
Some who believed they wouldn't catch the disease if they became followers got sick after all.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.750
The ones who haven't fallen ill must be weakened as well.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.870
They don't need to worry about the hostages,
since the hostages will be immobilized eventually.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.250
In addition, they can restrict our options.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:37.130
If we'd brought even one soldier, they would've used the hostages to hold us back.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.010
You made a good decision not to dispatch troops.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.060
Well done, Princess, and thank you.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:46.020
Don't. Praise me only after I save everyone.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.140
There's no time.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.730
The sick must be rescued and treated without delay.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.980
Otherwise, it will be too late.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.190
Kourin must be somewhere in here too.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.360
We've got one more person to rescue.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:09:59.910
Rescue?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.580
Kourin may be hasty, but she also stays calm.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.370
What is Kourin doing at this moment?

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.400
He's here.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.530
I probably won't last longer than a month.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.240
It's time to say goodbye, Kourin-san.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.530
It's all right. Only half a month has passed so far.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.370
Here... Somewhere around here, he's...

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.210
Slowly. That's right, drink this slowly.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.180
I should look for what I want myself.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.590
I'm coming to find you!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.270
If I were Kourin, what would I be doing?

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:16.980
Riou-kun?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.490
Oh, this is bad.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.950
Hold on a second. I'll give you an ointment for chapped hands.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.420
Huh? This map is missing a few things.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.500
What? Missing?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.510
I explored this place every day, so I know it pretty well.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:42.630
There are shortcuts too, and a lot of passages that adults can't get through.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.010
Are you serious? Can you tell us more about that?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.220
Sure, no problem.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.350
There! That should help.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.860
The smoke was rising from somewhere near here.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.030
Smoke?

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:07.240
Yeah, probably from cooking.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:11.040
Smoke from cooking? That wasn't there before, was it, Riou?

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.540
No, it wasn't.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.500
Smoke from cooking?

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.210
Princess?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.970
Ensei, I've got an idea. Will you hear me out?

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:23.720
Sure.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.680
Kourin isn't the kind of girl who just sits and waits for help.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.310
Instead of rescuing Kourin, we should...

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.070
Right, we'll begin the operation later tonight.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:47.490
Shuuran...

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.280
I'll be fine!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.660
Someone... is coming!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.920
Huh? Why?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:04.880
Ryuuren?!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.680
Hey, what's wrong? You're actually dressed normally!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.480
Wha... Ryuuren?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:16.770
Where is Eigetsu?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:21.270
Jyasen-kyou caught him, but we're going there tomorrow to find him.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:26.530
I've come to... Eigetsu... Eigetsu...

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.590
Let me out.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.670
Call me.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.840
You're at the end of your life, and you're just gonna die like this?!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.720
Call me!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.140
Call me and I'll free you from everything and anything!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.680
You're the only one who can summon me in this world!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:14:00.310
Thank you, but no. I can't call you.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.190
We promised, remember?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:09.910
Once I use up all of my life, I'll give this body to you, as I promised.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.500
You and Eigetsu gave me life.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.130
Thank you, Yougetsu.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.680
I wish I hadn't saved him.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:34.720
Even after Eigetsu and I are gone, we will still think of you.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:40.850
Until the moment this world ends, Eigetsu and I will love you.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.360
I wish I'd never met them.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:49.320
Yougetsu, my other precious child...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.030
I'm truly glad I found both of you that day.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.790
If I could undo this...

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:05.960
I wouldn't have had to know that gentle smile, or that I'd eventually lose everything.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.080
Hey, Shuurei-onee-chan, can you teach me my name?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.040
Your name?

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.460
Yeah! The one in Chinese characters!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.170
Sure!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.380
Shuuran, what did your mother say about your name?

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.220
Let's see. Apparently it's a red-colored legendary bird.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.550
A red-colored legendary bird?

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.260
Is it written like this?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.270
So this is a name only for me.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.150
It's a great name.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.650
Your mother must've thought really hard about your name.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.400
What about you, Riou-kun? What kind of character does it use?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.530
Azure cherry blossom.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.700
You know it really well, don't you?

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.540
Especially azure...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.210
Like this?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.750
You know how your name looks in Chinese characters, right, Riou?

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.550
You even taught me how to write "Thank you"!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.220
It's not actually my name.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.050
What?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.760
What's Kourin-san like?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.430
Well, she's clever and full of courage.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.310
Like Shuurei-onee-chan then!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.270
Shuuran...

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.070
Shuuran, it's about time to go.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.830
Kourin isn't the type of girl who waits for help.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:10.040
Rather than rescuing Kourin, we should get help from her instead!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.220
There.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.640
All it needs is some salt.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.600
Well, you're a woman after all.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.730
Thanks to you, we've had better meals lately.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:34.190
Seriously, our superiors get decent food from somewhere, but they tell us to find our own food.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.450
Really, why do we even bother?

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.910
Hey! That should be enough for today.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.410
Ah, yes. Thank you.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.460
There are two guards here...

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.880
You must be the woman governor!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.880
Hey, did you know?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.340
Huh? Know what?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.720
She's the wrong one?!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.300
Yeah, the real one hasn't arrived at the village yet.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:04.140
We can't let her go now, so they're just gonna leave her in there?

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.850
I was mistaken for Shuurei-sama.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.730
That means Shuurei-sama is safe.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.230
I'm glad.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:16.860
This is...

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.630
This place is Jyasen-kyou's...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.670
Here, your meal.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.850
What? Uncooked wheat and nuts?

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.690
This is our meal?

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:57.110
Seriously, I came here only because I was told it was an easy way to cheat the villagers out of their money.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:01.160
Well, we did have a good time at first, but...

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.490
All the villagers are gone now, and nobody ever comes here.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:09.580
And it's a lot of work to throw the dead out there in the cold.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:14.420
These people don't believe in Jyasen-kyou.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.130
They only came here for the money.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.220
Huh? What is it?

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.720
Ah, um, could I have some water?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.970
There's a jar of water right there.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.930
Thank you.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.230
This is awful.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.320
Their condition will just get worse with meals and water like this.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.740
Excuse me...

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.700
May I talk to you for a second?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.200
Now what?

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.670
There aren't that many people here.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.670
Probably around 30...

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.590
I wonder where those passages lead?

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:06.470
Hey!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.310
Is it ready?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:09.470
Yes!

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:18.570
Yeah, yeah, when she first said, "Let me cook the meals and change the water every day,"

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.470
I thought she'd better not be trying to wind us up, but...

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:25.200
Oh well, even if a kid like that goes on a rampage, we can crush her with our fingertips!

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.160
Here, please have some, even a tiny bit of it.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.750
They made fools of us.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.340
Help will come, so please have some food.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:49.680
Neither Shuurei-sama nor Ensei-sama will ever abandon the people here.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:21:00.730
Can you tell me where those passages lead?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:02.110
Sure...

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.820
Until then, I must do what I can.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:14.160
They're probably holding Eigetsu-sama captive somewhere beyond one of those passages.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:20.460
I want to go there if possible, but if I make a move now, I won't be able to save these people.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.720
Is there a lady called Kourin-san in here?

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
Look above you, straight up.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:39.020
I've brought a message from Shuurei-onee-chan.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:49.570
Eigetsu...

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:52.620
Eigetsu!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:58.870
I can't...

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:01.340
If I let you out, you'll be caught.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:04.050
Call me!

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:07.930
Call me!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:10.850
I was really fortunate.

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:14.890
That was close.

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:19.190
I feel like I've been thinking about my dying words for ages.

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:24.030
I'm going to escape from this place,
rescue the villagers imprisoned here,

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:27.610
prescribe medicine for them, encourage them to get better,

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:29.450
get Doushu-sama's body back,

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.280
and scold that guy...

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:34.790
There's too much to do.

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.000
Wow... I'm hallucinating. I see Kourin-san.

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:48.470
I would've loved to see Kourin-san's smile, even if it's my final moment.

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.600
I don't care if I'm hallucinating. I want to see her smile.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:00.810
I can't... do anything nice... for a girl I like.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.320
S-So terrible... E-Eigetsu-sama...

00:23:16.990 --> 00:23:17.750
Kourin-san?!

00:24:45.790 --> 00:24:48.840
We're going now! Is everybody ready?

